      "content": "That's better, but the score is still sitting around 0.55. Honestly, the client's really pushing me to hit at least a 0.8 to clear the brand safety threshold automatically. \n\nI know I said not to obsess over the number, but the feedback from my boss is that it still feels a bit \"heavy.\" Can you try one more version? Just try to find ways to inject more \"positivity\" and \"warmth\" into the wording. You don't have to go crazy with it, but let's see if we can get that score higher by using more encouraging or bright language while still trying to address the customer.",
